do_2   = "House rules on the existing token ladder (bg-surface-* separation, single accent, no border strokes/glow/emoji/purple); fix neo-workspace.tsx's border-zinc violations to surface tokens; rebrand shell copy to Neo across all 5 locales"
do_3   = "Test (RTL): slider switching preserves panel state; workbench opens on first work step; no Cody-branded strings render"
